{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "740920059e27d66a7004a05496612a338f8734a9f35e1a0057210d26dbed0f67", "ja": "（今日は環と公園で遊ぶ約束をしている。\nそろそろ来る頃だと思うけど……）", "zh": "（今天和环约好要在公园玩。差不多也该来了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "b68df89908a89131ce6757de162f2e79a4717cdea463d3e9959ae655cfcbc044", "ja": "わああ～！　おやぶん、おくれてごめんなさい！\nいっぱい準備してたらおそくなっちゃった……。", "zh": "哇啊啊～！老大，对不起，我来晚了！\n准备了好多东西，不小心就迟到了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
