{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "5d29947a536b826a6497fcc8fce4937235a9e810e3cba6caf9c62c117ef4dc1d", "ja": "うん！　公園で遊ぶなら、これがいいよって。\nお母さんが選ぶの手伝ってくれたの。", "zh": "嗯！妈妈帮我一起挑的，说是在公园玩的话，这件比较合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "3efe096e26552dedbb17f828a7685d21f2d9817af10e74b7bece97f81475573f", "ja": "あのね。この服、お父さんとお母さんに買ってもらった\nばかりなんだ。お仕事がんばってる、ごほうびにって♪", "zh": "我跟你说哦。这身衣服是爸爸和妈妈刚买给环的\n呢。说是给环努力工作的奖励哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "4b3184382e9d1fa093d711cbd98f89fc9bdf07f8f4a559ccdeebb4732873255e", "ja": "ねえねえおやぶん、似合ってる？\nこの服、たまきにバッチリ～？", "zh": "喂喂，老大，合适吗？\n这身衣服很适合小环吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f9248da38ff1b56310e82c978ca1890596fabca7599ec53939f842a2f88a1696", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ！\nすごくかわいいよ。環が選んだのかな？", "zh": "啊，非常合适！\n特别可爱哦。是环自己选的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "a99b91592e623b0002a1f0f458d0c017ae940faac00e0041eb74ec6ccf07245e", "ja": "くふふ♪　おやぶん、ハズレ～！\nこの服は、みんなで選んだんだよ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 老大，猜错啦～  \n这件衣服是大家一起选的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "a16a3118c68bc6d2fc15a5450e98b1004e64b0566d9041e10498535970684cc5", "ja": "おやぶんがほめてくれるのはどれかなーって、\nお父さんとお母さんと一緒に考えたの！", "zh": "我和爸爸妈妈一起想了想，哪一件会得到老大夸奖呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "97b667131e7ea30d3bdb6819b7d14f0a8aeb28bf301a664023858630cf7fa8ff", "ja": "だからね、おやぶんがほめてくれて、すっごく嬉しい♪\nいっぱい考えてよかった～！", "zh": "所以呢，能得到老大夸奖，环特别开心♪ 仔细想了这么多，果然没白费～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1010_p", "source_sha256": "eac516b499ef67ce42617c39f93099bf3bc6ac0fd1f51c09bc505fc4b4157750", "ja": "ははっ、環の作戦は大成功だな。\nその髪型も、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，环的作战大成功啊。\n这个发型也很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "5435789e0b3b4491ff321e84f75330547a1ee09d0b0257977c8ccd15593e442e", "ja": "えへへ……。おやぶんと遊ぶって言ったら、\nお母さんが、たまきの好きな髪型にしてくれたの。", "zh": "嘿嘿……我说要和老大一起玩，妈妈就给我弄成了我喜欢的发型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1012_p", "source_sha256": "047f1a3af07f99465f86de459faf3a2d0c04b1b0f5a622a1c1b74da5739be659", "ja": "そうだったのか。よかったな。\nおっと……そろそろ公園に向かおうか。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。那太好了。\n哦……差不多该去公园了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "66668046e81f4e3e65e2e509468c4dcac859984e31d6e7a11e3b522c090689c5", "ja": "あっ！　あのね、おやぶん……。\n公園で遊ぶ約束だけど、違う日にしてもいい？", "zh": "啊！那个，老大……  \n之前约好去公园玩的事，可以改到别的日子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a5c2ed3b1ef66ca873f431856fc27ad03056880ac0b982696b4c5c175f35c9e1", "ja": "違う日に？　環がいいなら、構わないけど……。\n理由を聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "换一天？环觉得可以的话，我没意见，不过……能问问原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "11c8ac8e027216f3c9c0a826490e0be669522d51db3fc7460d3e939fa1c07743", "ja": "うん……。たまき、公園に行ったら思いきり遊んじゃう\nと思うんだ。そしたら、洋服が汚れちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "嗯……环要是去了公园，肯定会尽情玩个痛快的。那样的话，衣服会弄脏的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "19ac9d61abd6b07aacc240ba768b1c3c2aa0b1111840df0b95999809f6d5e841", "ja": "おやぶんがほめてくれたのに……汚れたら悲しいぞ。\nでも思いきり遊べないのも、悲しいし……。", "zh": "明明大叔还夸过我……要是弄脏了，会很难过的。\n可是不能尽情玩，也会很难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5597f582c83ca831c5bed12ba0ff32596815f946846657d9bde905aaabb06527", "ja": "そうか……。よし、わかった！\nそれなら、今日はのんびり散歩でもしようか。", "zh": "这样啊……好，我明白了！  \n那今天就悠闲地散散步吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "59462a4e384e260e0ad42423081690b0a844ddcad7ef49b3058e8bb2af618399", "ja": "お散歩……。うん！　たまき、お散歩がいい！\nおやぶん、ありがとう～♪", "zh": "散步……嗯！环，想去散步！\n老大，谢谢你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0334_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "d26e9e4b45c1bcb5c66758dc25216e1a171d8058830ed34e3dfed66646510c56", "ja": "お散歩お散歩～♪　おやぶんとお散歩～♪\nおやぶん、いーっぱいおしゃべりしようね。くふふっ♪", "zh": "散步散步～♪和大叔一起散步～♪\n大叔，我们聊好多好多话吧。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
